      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file for rotating a secret version, I need to select a concrete external provider for managing secrets. AWS Secrets Manager is a suitable choice for this task. The code will use the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with AWS Secrets Manager. The provider will be identifiable in the code through the import of the Boto3 library and the use of AWS-specific functions and parameters. </thinking>\n",
